  {
   "id": "e110",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 820,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 584.1,
   "height": 450.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 714075261,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 186293890,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each probe gets three connections:\n\nProbe 1 (green)\n  • pin 1 (left block, inner column, top)  →  probe contact\n  • probe's other contact  →  GND\n  • 10 kΩ from pin 1  →  3V3\n\nProbe 2 (blue)\n  • pin 2 (left block, outer column, 2nd)  →  probe contact\n  • probe's other contact  →  GND\n  • 10 kΩ from pin 2  →  3V3\n\nThe Mini has only ONE 3V3 hole (bottom left).\nBoth resistors share it: run 3V3 to a breadboard\nrow or rail and put both resistor legs there.\nSame for GND and the two probes.\n\nProbe contacts and resistors: either way round.\n\nWorking: t0 and t1 both ≈ 20–25 °C",
   "originalText": "Each probe gets three connections:\n\nProbe 1 (green)\n  • pin 1 (left block, inner column, top)  →  probe contact\n  • probe's other contact  →  GND\n  • 10 kΩ from pin 1  →  3V3\n\nProbe 2 (blue)\n  • pin 2 (left block, outer column, 2nd)  →  probe contact\n  • probe's other contact  →  GND\n  • 10 kΩ from pin 2  →  3V3\n\nThe Mini has only ONE 3V3 hole (bottom left).\nBoth resistors share it: run 3V3 to a breadboard\nrow or rail and put both resistor legs there.\nSame for GND and the two probes.\n\nProbe contacts and resistors: either way round.\n\nWorking: t0 and t1 both ≈ 20–25 °C",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
